url: "https://github.com/EliHei2/scicraft"
abstract: >-
  Skills for Claude Code that carry a researcher's working craft: figures and
  schematics, paper, book and rebuttal writing, typesetting, talks and posters,
  quality gates, integrity audits, project structure, machine-learning experiment
  design and evaluation, and work with AI agents. Distilled from a year of
  research sessions and audited against their records.
keywords:
  - agent skills
  - Claude Code
  - scientific writing
  - scientific figures
  - machine learning research
  - reproducibility
